    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lu'duko lwa V'aizilaeli ku' nsi' ya Misili",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aga hu' mina ga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'amwa Izilaeli, ku' lina li'ngi' Yakobo, av'o ndi' waya nav'o ku' nsi' ya Misili, ki'la yu'mo wayaga na mugana gwakwe: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubeni, Simiyoni, Lawi, Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isakali, Sebuloni, Benyamini, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dani, Nafutali, Gadi na Asheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'yalwa v'ose v'amwa Yakobo v'av'age maku'mi mupungati'. Itungo lyeni'lo Yosefu wasangwa watongelile kwenu'ko ku' Misili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyav'i'ta itungo, Yosefu na v'adu'gu'ye, haki'mo na izyi'ka lya itungo lyeni'lo, v'agulalaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi V'aizilaeli v'asangwa v'akiv'yala na kwingi'ha muno. Wingi wav'o wav'aga na nguzu muno na v'asambalaga mu nsi' yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' watemaga mutemi yu'ngi' mu nsi' ya Misili u'yo wav'age akamumanya Yosefu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe wav'awi'laga v'antu' v'akwe ati', “Lingagi, V'aizilaeli v'av'aga v'ingi muno, hangi' v'ali' na nguzu ku'ki'la iswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi'li'ku'dima ku'koov'e nzi'la ya ku'v'ahangi'li'zya ki'gele v'aleke kwingi'ha, ku'nguno u'lu' wigele wu'lu'gu' v'akowolile kwisangya na v'anisi v'iswe ku'lasana niswe, na ku'toloka mu nsi' yeni'yi'.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene V'amisili v'atu'u'laga v'i'mi'li'zi v'a ku'v'i'mi'li'zya V'aizilaeli na v'av'atu'mamyaga mili'mo zya wu'sese. V'aizilaeli v'atu'mamaga mili'mo zya ku'muzyengela Falao",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lina Falao li'li' isumbi' lya wu'temi ku' Misili.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kaya zya Pitomu na Lamesesi zya ku'tu'u'li'la viv'ango vyamwa Falao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi, aho v'atusiv'agwa, na hu' vyene v'endeleyaga kwingi'ha na ku'sambala mu nsi'. Ku'nguno yeni'yo V'amisili v'av'ogohaga muno V'aizilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene V'amisili v'av'atu'mamyaga V'aizilaeli ku' wu'kandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "V'av'av'ezyaga v'av'e na wikalo wu'lambu ku'nguno ya mili'mo mitimbu zya nswakala na matofali, na mili'mo zyose zya mu migu'nda. Mugati' na mili'mo zyose V'amisili v'av'atu'mamyaga V'aizilaeli ku' wu'kandi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' mutemi wa Misili wav'awi'laga Shifula na Pua, av'o v'av'age v'ingi' v'a v'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania, ati', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ha itungo lya ku'v'av'yazya v'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania muv'e muli'wikomya. U'lu' wav'yalwa mwana wa ki'gosya mumuwu'lage, na u'lu' wa ki'ki'ma mumuleke azuwu'ke.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali'vi v'enav'o v'av'age v'amogohile Mulungu. V'akav'ezizye ki'ti' mutemi wa Misili i'vyo walagi'li'zizye, sumbwa v'av'alekaga v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'azuwu'ke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hohene mutemi wa Misili wav'itanaga v'ingi' v'enav'o na ku'v'awu'zya ati', “Ku' ki' mwav'ezyaga vyeni'vyo, ku'v'aleka v'ana v'a ki'gosya v'azuwu'ke?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nav'o v'asu'v'yaga ati', “V'aki'ma v'a Ki'ebulania v'ali' v'asiliganzi, na v'ali' na nguzu. V'akav'ile ki'ti' v'aki'ma v'a Ki'misili. Itungo v'ingi' v'akaali' ku'fika, v'eni'ki'li' v'ali'sangagwa v'ipeku'laga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku'nguno yeni'yo, Mulungu wav'av'ezezyaga masoga v'ingi' v'enav'o, na V'aizilaeli v'ingi'haga na ku'v'a na nguzu nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku' i'vyo v'ingi' v'enav'o v'av'age v'ali'mogoha Mulungu, na Mulungu wav'apaga migana zyav'o v'eni'ki'li'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangi' Falao wafumyaga ilagi'li'zyo ku' v'antu' v'akwe v'ose na ku'v'awi'la ati', “Ki'la mwana wa ki'gosya u'yo alav'yalwe na V'aebulania atagi'lwe mu mongo gwa Naili, ali'vi mwana wa ki'ki'ma mumuleke azuwu'ke.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
